 "about": {
  "text": "Ridley Scott’s Gladiator duology in a double feature! To fully appreciate Paul Mescal’s role as Lucius in GLADIATOR II—and simply because it’s such a treat—it’s worth revisiting the political intrigues of the classic GLADIATOR starring Russell Crowe. This way, both fans and newcomers can (re)discover the epic for themselves. And to really go all out, we’ve got the full dose of leather straps thanks to the Extended Edition of GLADIATOR. So it’s time to put on your sandals and cheer from the front row as the gladiators battle it out in the Colosseum!",
